  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Grate carrot.<br>• Drain and rinse kidney beans. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87360cade9b9f0acf1c9e/step-f3b65200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook carrot and kidney beans until tender, 3-4 mins.<br>• Add tomato paste and BBQ spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. <br>• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in the water and cook until slightly thickened, 1 min. Season with salt.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87360cade9b9f0acf1c9e/step-e7c5d210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix, the mayonnaise and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.<br>• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87360cade9b9f0acf1c9e/step-1c03b520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Build tacos by filling tortillas with creamy slaw and smokey BBQ beans. <br>• Sprinkle over cheese to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87360cade9b9f0acf1c9e/step-82e44e30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
